  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？\r\nそうなのか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004050130,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "無いかもっていうか、\r\n別にやりたいことって今やればいいなって思って",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300405/1023004050130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "………………！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004050140,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "歌ったり踊ったりしてステージに立ってるのも\r\nそのステージをどういうふうにするか考えるのも",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300405/1023004050140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004050150,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "今やってるし、これからもやりたいでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/102300405/1023004050150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hinana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1023004050160,
    "speaker": "雛菜",
    "text": "雑誌に出たりたまに番組に出たりとかもしてるし、\r\nやってないことだと～……ブランドプロデュースとか？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
